WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.757
The learning outcomes explain what you will practise In

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:05.757
this learning unit you will prepare a clear working

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:10.021
agreement and a reasoned decision brief The outcomes below

00:00:10.086 --> 00:00:13.139
describe the capabilities that the teaching and practice will

00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:17.060
help you develop Your practice drafts are not evidence

00:00:17.099 --> 00:00:19.876
of formal competence until they have been reviewed through

00:00:19.942 --> 00:00:24.099
the authorised assessment process What will be expected of

00:00:24.126 --> 00:00:26.942
you in this LU In this learning activity you

00:00:26.981 --> 00:00:30.297
will explain the missing confirmation and a role-appropriate next

00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:35.323
step Outcomes linked to this activity EA-01 . 3

00:00:35.652 --> 00:00:39.455
Distinguish EA responsibilities from those of a personal assistant

00:00:39.718 --> 00:00:43.915
office manager chief of staff and specialist adviser and

00:00:43.968 --> 00:00:49.192
refer work outside the agreed mandate EA-01 . 5

00:00:49.376 --> 00:00:53.784
Agree a safe route for raising concerns resolving expectations

00:00:53.863 --> 00:00:57.073
and arranging an authorised deputy without making the role

00:00:57.126 --> 00:01:02.256
dependent on permanent availability Learning practice and acknowledgement are

00:01:02.269 --> 00:01:05.348
